[(conversions are made for the rest. Blobs are lists of bytes that start with an atom)]
[(count followed by that number of elements \050if an element is a symbol, its first byte)]
[(is sent\051. If the count is negative, the entire remaining message is included in the)]
[(blob \050but the OSC parser will report the actual number of elements\051.)]
